    "text": "heartoftherockiesradio.com\nwebsite\nBuena Vista\nDUI Arrest After UTV Driven into Arkansas River Near Ruby Mountain Campground\nBy Dan R,\n1 days agoOn Sunday August 3rd, 2025 at approximately 12:55PM the Chaffee County Sheriff’s Office Dispatch Center received a call concerning a side-by-side UTV that was stuck in the Arkansas River near the Ruby Mountain Campground off County Road 300 in Buena Vista, CO. Chaffee County Sheriff’s Office Deputies, Buena Vista Police Officers and members of Colorado Parks and Wildlife responded.",
